# 09 - Implementation Roadmap

## Phase 1: Assessment (Month 1–2)

* Analyze current processes
* Identify risks and gaps

## Phase 2: Design (Month 3–4)

* Define architecture and controls
* Design new onboarding workflow

## Phase 3: Implementation (Month 5–6)

* Deploy RBAC and MFA
* Automate onboarding system

## Phase 4: Monitoring (Month 7)

* Implement logging and monitoring
* Track performance and risks

## Phase 5: Continuous Improvement

* Conduct periodic reviews
* Update controls and processes

## Conclusion

A phased approach ensures controlled and sustainable implementation.
